   "questionHtml": "נתונה טבלת גיבוב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> בשיטת הגיבוב הליניארי, המשתמשת בפונקצית הגיבוב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(x) = x \\bmod 10</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br><br>הטבלה: <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[0]</code> ריק, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[1] = 61</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[2] = 52</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[3] = 93</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[4] = 11</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[5] = 85</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[6] = 44</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[7] = 73</code>, <code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[8]</code> ו-<code class=\"tok\" dir=\"ltr\">A[9]</code> ריקים.<br><br>אילו מהסדרות הבאות יכולה להיות סדרת הכנסה לטבלה (יש לקרוא את הסדרות משמאל לימין):",
   "solutionHtml": "- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>93</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>93</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(93) = 93 \\bmod 10 = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>61</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(61) = 61 \\bmod 10 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>85</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(85) = 85 \\bmod 10 = 5</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>52</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(52) = 52 \\bmod 10 = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span>.<br>- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>11</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(11) = 11 \\bmod 10 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span>: התא תפוס כבר. לפי גיבוב ליניארי, <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span> ייכנס לתא הפנוי הבא (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span>).<br>- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>44</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(44) = 44 \\bmod 10 = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span>: התא תפוס על ידי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>44</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44</annotation></semantics></math></span> ייכנס לתא הפנוי הבא (<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span>).<br>- <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>73</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>73</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(73) = 73 \\bmod 10 = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span>: התאים <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span> עד <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span> תפוסים, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>73</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">73</annotation></semantics></math></span> ייכנס ל-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
